Antibiotic Stock Recipe
========================


===========================  ==================================  ==========================  ===================================
Antibiotic                   Recommended Stock Conc.             Recommended Working Conc.   Weight of AB for 10 ml stock soln.
===========================  ==================================  ==========================  ===================================
Ampicillin/Carbenicillin     100 mg/mL (filter sterilize)        100 µg/mL                   1000 mg
Chloramphenicol              25 mg/mL (dissolve in 50% EtOH)     25 µg/mL                    250 mg
Erythromycin                 250 mg/mL (dissolve in 100% EtOH)   250 µg/mL                   2500 mg
Gentamycin                   10 mg/mL (filter sterilize)         10 µg/mL                    100 mg
Nalidixic Acid               5 mg/mL (filter sterilize)          5 µg/mL                     50 mg
Kanamycin                    50 mg/mL (filter sterilize)         50 µg/mL                    500 mg
Spectinomycin/Streptomycin   50 mg/mL (filter sterilize)         50 µg/mL                    500 mg
Tetracycline                 10 mg/mL  (dissolve in 75% EtOH)    10 µg/mL                    100 mg
===========================  ==================================  ==========================  ===================================
